  "Wise Advice is the Special Edition Effect (not the later Defensive Shield). The starting Effect varies by matchup in the strategy (Battle Order, Wise Advice, Battle Plan), so no starting Effect is set; Battle Order, named as a start against Hunt Down and Operatives, is not in the list (not added).",
